a beanbag chair


00:38:13.208 --> 00:38:14.514
and some comic books.


00:38:16.037 --> 00:38:17.256
What happened here?


00:38:17.952 --> 00:38:19.127
[hard grunt]


00:38:19.302 --> 00:38:21.434
I'’m tired
of giving you warnings!


00:38:22.305 --> 00:38:24.307
[grunts, yells]


00:38:25.308 --> 00:38:26.700
Where'’d you go, hedgehog?


00:38:26.874 --> 00:38:28.746
I wasn'’t finished
trauma dumping.


00:38:30.574 --> 00:38:33.359
My darlings!


00:38:33.533 --> 00:38:35.056
[inhales, giggles]


00:38:35.230 --> 00:38:37.668
My eggy weggies!


00:38:38.799 --> 00:38:41.846
[professor] ♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:42.020 --> 00:38:45.371
♪ <i>Light the corners</i>♪


00:38:45.545 --> 00:38:49.201
♪ <i>Of my mind</i>♪


00:38:49.375 --> 00:38:52.509
♪ <i>Misty watercolor</i>♪


00:38:52.683 --> 00:38:58.297
♪ <i>Memories</i>♪


00:38:58.471 --> 00:39:01.344
♪ <i>Of the way</i>♪


00:39:01.518 --> 00:39:06.784
♪ <i>We weren'’t</i>♪


00:39:07.741 --> 00:39:08.742
I...


00:39:10.483 --> 00:39:12.224
don'’t believe it.Don'’t you?


00:39:12.398 --> 00:39:13.660
It'’s impossible.Is it?


00:39:13.834 --> 00:39:14.748
It couldn'’t be.Couldn'’t it?


00:39:14.922 --> 00:39:15.706
I'’m--Are you?


00:39:15.880 --> 00:39:17.055
Imposter!


00:39:17.229 --> 00:39:19.492
You stole my babies!


00:39:19.666 --> 00:39:22.843
But they know
who their real daddy is...


00:39:23.017 --> 00:39:24.105
drone-napper!


00:39:24.279 --> 00:39:25.803
[chortling]


00:39:25.977 --> 00:39:29.067
Magnificent creations,
my boy.


00:39:29.241 --> 00:39:31.809
