00:39:35.726 --> 00:39:37.380
You see, Ivo...


00:39:39.512 --> 00:39:42.515
I'’m your grandfather:


00:39:42.689 --> 00:39:45.126
Gerald Robotnik.


00:39:49.174 --> 00:39:51.872
