00:39:53.613 --> 00:39:56.486
But how? And why?


00:39:57.269 --> 00:39:59.314
And who did what with whom?


00:39:59.489 --> 00:40:04.407
You hail from an ancestry
of excellence...


00:40:04.581 --> 00:40:07.148
tied directly <i>à moi.</i>


00:40:07.322 --> 00:40:10.238
Yes, I know French.


00:40:12.763 --> 00:40:14.286
You do look like me.


00:40:15.243 --> 00:40:17.202
But fatter. And older.


00:40:18.072 --> 00:40:20.031
And there'’s that funny smell.


00:40:21.728 --> 00:40:24.557
But the resemblance
is uncanny.


00:40:25.428 --> 00:40:27.038
It'’s as if...


00:40:27.212 --> 00:40:29.301
[both]
...we'’re two characters in a movie


00:40:29.475 --> 00:40:32.043
