by the same actor.


00:40:32.217 --> 00:40:34.654
But I need real proof!Ivo!


00:40:34.828 --> 00:40:36.134
We have very little time.


00:40:37.657 --> 00:40:39.790
But I could field
a couple of queries.


00:40:39.964 --> 00:40:43.097
Name the most elegant formula
in mathematics.


00:40:43.271 --> 00:40:44.621
Euler'’s Identity.


00:40:44.795 --> 00:40:47.101
E to the I times pi plus one
equals zilch.


00:40:47.275 --> 00:40:49.103
European capitals
arranged alphabetically


00:40:49.277 --> 00:40:50.540
by the fourth letter.


00:40:50.714 --> 00:40:52.455
Riga, Monaco, Sarajevo, Tirana.


00:40:52.629 --> 00:40:54.413
The speed of light
divided by the speed of sound,


00:40:54.587 --> 00:40:56.633
divided by
the speed of the bus in the movie <i>Speed.</i>


00:40:56.807 --> 00:40:58.156
[mimics adding machine]


00:40:58.330 --> 00:41:00.898
17,893.33333...


00:41:01.072 --> 00:41:04.510
Rounding up?17,894 MPH.


00:41:04.684 --> 00:41:07.165
And, for all the marbles...


00:41:07.339 --> 00:41:09.515
Good. I lost mine.


00:41:09.689 --> 00:41:11.735
A rare lung disease,


00:41:11.909 --> 00:41:14.999
and the longest word
in the English dictionary.


00:41:15.652 --> 00:41:17.131
Um...


00:41:17.305 --> 00:41:20.613
[both] Pneumonoultramicroscopic-
silicovolcanoconiosis!


00:41:21.484 --> 00:41:25.139
Pap-pap!In the saggy flesh.


00:41:25.313 --> 00:41:27.402
