00:41:29.840 --> 00:41:32.451
Oh, Grampy-poo! [laughs]


00:41:35.846 --> 00:41:39.632
Where have you been
my entire life?


00:41:39.806 --> 00:41:41.373
[moans happily]


00:41:41.547 --> 00:41:43.549
