00:42:26.461 --> 00:42:28.855
[groaning]


00:42:31.858 --> 00:42:33.817
Oh, no. Oh, no, no.


00:42:33.991 --> 00:42:35.819
Someone tell me
this is some kind of


00:42:35.993 --> 00:42:38.125
