exposition!


00:43:09.374 --> 00:43:11.463
Shadow, get the key.


00:43:11.637 --> 00:43:12.638
Where is it?


00:43:12.812 --> 00:43:14.901
Ha! Good one, Hot Topic.


00:43:15.075 --> 00:43:17.164
Do you really think
we'’d be that stupid


00:43:17.338 --> 00:43:19.384
