<i>the most powerful weapon</i>


00:43:40.144 --> 00:43:42.668
<i>mankind has ever seen,</i>


00:43:42.842 --> 00:43:45.410
<i>capable of delivering</i>
<i>a precision strike</i>


00:43:45.584 --> 00:43:46.977
<i>anywhere on Earth.</i>


00:43:48.413 --> 00:43:49.632
<i>Our first target:</i>


00:43:50.458 --> 00:43:52.112
<i>GUN Headquarters.</i>


00:43:52.286 --> 00:43:54.419
But firing a weapon
that powerful


00:43:54.593 --> 00:43:56.551
could threaten millions
of innocent lives!


00:43:56.726 --> 00:43:58.989
Yeah, tera-bite me.[cackles]


00:43:59.163 --> 00:44:04.037
This is one of two keys required
to launch the Eclipse Cannon.


00:44:04.211 --> 00:44:06.518
The other is locked
inside GUN headquarters.


00:44:06.692 --> 00:44:08.563
Once we have both,


00:44:08.738 --> 00:44:11.566
I will take rightful control
of my weapon.


00:44:11.741 --> 00:44:13.525
I'’m in.


00:44:20.488 --> 00:44:21.968
Holy crab!


00:44:22.142 --> 00:44:23.753
