this little adventure.


00:44:27.844 --> 00:44:30.020
It really worked out
for me.


00:44:30.194 --> 00:44:33.153
And you wonder why
I have trust issues!


00:44:34.633 --> 00:44:36.809
Shadow, wait! Don'’t do this.


00:44:36.983 --> 00:44:38.376
I know you'’re hurting,


00:44:38.550 --> 00:44:41.074
