one of my rings!


00:45:27.947 --> 00:45:29.166
[Sonic] Got one.


00:45:29.340 --> 00:45:31.559
Check this out. Trick shot!


00:45:31.734 --> 00:45:32.952
[grunts]


00:45:35.259 --> 00:45:36.739
Come on.


00:45:38.001 --> 00:45:39.567
Come on.


00:45:39.742 --> 00:45:41.395
Come on.[Knuckles groans]


00:45:43.006 --> 00:45:44.703
[both] Come on!


00:45:45.443 --> 00:45:46.357
[yells]


00:45:46.531 --> 00:45:48.707
[all yelling]


00:45:54.104 --> 00:45:56.628
Yeah! Yes!


00:46:00.327 --> 00:46:01.328
[Sonic] Yikes.


00:46:02.634 --> 00:46:04.418
Somebody better call
Google Maps.


00:46:05.593 --> 00:46:08.161
[rumbling faintly]


00:46:08.335 --> 00:46:12.470
I'’ve spent years
trying to cleanse the cosmos


00:46:12.644 --> 00:46:16.300
