00:48:23.514 --> 00:48:24.994
[song ends]


00:48:34.525 --> 00:48:35.961
And done!


00:48:36.135 --> 00:48:38.877
Masterpiece.
Look at that.Yay!


00:48:39.051 --> 00:48:42.489
It'’s really been great
having time to ourselves.


00:48:42.663 --> 00:48:45.101
Right. Absolutely.
I just feel so...


00:48:45.275 --> 00:48:46.667
