Clearheaded.


00:48:46.841 --> 00:48:49.148
Mmm, look at all these
new interests we found.


00:48:49.322 --> 00:48:51.324
I know, so many hobbies.So many!


00:48:51.498 --> 00:48:54.327
After the action and adventure
of the last few years,


00:48:54.501 --> 00:48:56.721
well, I could get used to this.Same.


00:48:56.895 --> 00:48:58.897
[deep rumbling]


00:49:02.466 --> 00:49:04.816
[Sonic] Tom! Maddie!
We need your help on a super--


00:49:04.990 --> 00:49:07.819
Knuckles, do you mind?Oh! Excuse me.


00:49:07.993 --> 00:49:09.429
Tom! Maddie! We need your help


00:49:09.603 --> 00:49:11.127
