top-secret mission!


00:49:11.301 --> 00:49:12.345
Hmm.


00:49:14.086 --> 00:49:15.740
Thank God. Yeah, we'’re in.Let'’s go.


00:49:15.914 --> 00:49:18.134
Really? You'’re in?
Just like that?


00:49:18.308 --> 00:49:21.050
Yes. It was getting so boring
without you guys here.Yeah. So...


00:49:21.224 --> 00:49:22.877
No offense....boring. No, none taken.


00:49:23.052 --> 00:49:24.531
I mean, whatever crazy plan
you'’re cooking up,


00:49:24.705 --> 00:49:26.011
the answer'’s yes.Yes.


00:49:26.185 --> 00:49:29.145
Great. But first things first:
What is that?


00:49:29.319 --> 00:49:30.798
Oh! This is...


00:49:30.973 --> 00:49:32.409
[in puppet voice]
...Li'’l Tom!


00:49:32.583 --> 00:49:34.063
