Whoa!


01:02:55.689 --> 01:02:57.691
My feet. Why can'’t I
use my beautiful feet?


01:02:57.866 --> 01:02:59.345
Heh-heh![Rockwell] Because...


01:02:59.519 --> 01:03:02.566
this vault is armed
with variable gravity.


01:03:02.740 --> 01:03:03.959
[straining]


01:03:04.133 --> 01:03:04.960
No kidding.


01:03:05.134 --> 01:03:06.918
[Rockwell] Green goes up...


01:03:07.092 --> 01:03:09.268
and red takes you down... hard.


01:03:09.442 --> 01:03:10.617
Rockwell, listen to me.


01:03:10.792 --> 01:03:12.576
The Robotniks are planning to--
[yelps]


01:03:12.750 --> 01:03:14.665
Oh, they'’re planning on stealing
a second key, just like you are?


01:03:14.839 --> 01:03:16.232
Yes, I'’m aware.


01:03:17.755 --> 01:03:20.279
I called it
the second Commander Walters was attacked.


01:03:20.453 --> 01:03:21.933
So...


01:03:22.107 --> 01:03:24.675
thank you
for taking the bait


01:03:24.849 --> 01:03:26.329
and falling
right into my trap.


01:03:26.503 --> 01:03:28.635
I don'’t believe this.


01:03:28.810 --> 01:03:30.420
[Gerald]
I know, grandson.


01:03:30.594 --> 01:03:32.596
A woman in the military!


01:03:34.511 --> 01:03:35.947
Let'’s go.


01:03:37.035 --> 01:03:38.254
Go, positions!


01:03:38.428 --> 01:03:39.516
Full perimeter.


01:03:39.690 --> 01:03:40.909
[weapons powering up]


01:03:41.083 --> 01:03:42.388
Robotnik.


01:03:42.562 --> 01:03:44.826
Going full spandex, huh?
Who'’s the fossil?


01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:49.134
That'’s my grandfather,
you dough-eating dimbecile.


01:03:49.308 --> 01:03:52.398
Who are they?A couple of bleeding hearts,


01:03:52.572 --> 01:03:55.401
here to rescue
their emotional-support animals.


01:03:55.575 --> 01:03:57.360
Enough! It'’s over.


01:03:57.534 --> 01:04:01.103
The only way
you'’re leaving here is in handcuffs.


01:04:01.277 --> 01:04:02.974
There is no other way out.


01:04:03.148 --> 01:04:05.934
You know, there might be
one other way out.


01:04:06.108 --> 01:04:07.500
And what is that
supposed to mean?


01:04:07.674 --> 01:04:09.589
[Sonic] Hey, big guy,
I think it'’s time to...


01:04:10.764 --> 01:04:14.072
Break glass
in case of emergency!


01:04:16.031 --> 01:04:18.076
[roaring]


01:04:18.947 --> 01:04:20.209
[grunts]


01:04:21.210 --> 01:04:24.256
Ha! Nothing can stop
Team Knuckles!


01:04:24.430 --> 01:04:25.518
Open fire!


01:04:26.519 --> 01:04:28.391
[yelps] Knuckles,
turn this stuff off!


01:04:28.565 --> 01:04:29.871
Hurry!On it.


01:04:31.481 --> 01:04:32.569
Uh-oh.


01:04:32.743 --> 01:04:34.701
[all yelling in surprise]


01:04:34.876 --> 01:04:36.878
[grunting]


01:04:40.185 --> 01:04:42.535
Ha! See how you like it--
[groans]


01:04:42.709 --> 01:04:44.711
[yelping]


01:04:46.278 --> 01:04:48.063
[both gasp]


01:04:48.237 --> 01:04:49.891
[all groaning]


01:04:50.065 --> 01:04:52.110
Can you move?No, not at all.


01:04:52.284 --> 01:04:54.721
Tails, can you?No, I'’m stuck.


01:04:54.896 --> 01:04:56.288
We might be here a while.


01:04:56.462 --> 01:04:58.464
[growls, grunts]


01:04:58.638 --> 01:05:00.902
Whoa! Whoa. Whoa. Whoa.


01:05:01.903 --> 01:05:03.339
Where'’s the key?


01:05:09.258 --> 01:05:10.476
Whoa!


01:05:10.650 --> 01:05:13.305
What was that?We might have a problem.


01:05:14.959 --> 01:05:16.918
[grunts] No, no, no, no!


01:05:18.093 --> 01:05:20.573
[grunting]


01:05:24.577 --> 01:05:26.188
[exclaims]


01:05:27.102 --> 01:05:28.190
[huffs]


01:05:37.634 --> 01:05:39.723
I'’m moving.


01:05:40.506 --> 01:05:42.117
I'’m moving!


01:05:45.294 --> 01:05:47.731
You go get it, grandson!


01:05:48.471 --> 01:05:49.515
Hey!


01:05:49.689 --> 01:05:51.517
Oh, whoa, whoa...


01:05:54.042 --> 01:05:55.913
No. No, no!


01:05:56.522 --> 01:05:58.220
I'’m almost there!


01:06:01.049 --> 01:06:01.832
Whoa!


01:06:02.006 --> 01:06:03.399
[groaning]


01:06:07.011 --> 01:06:08.578
Sonic!


01:06:15.019 --> 01:06:17.717
[gasps][all yelling, grunting]


01:06:17.891 --> 01:06:18.762
[heavy grunt]


01:06:20.155 --> 01:06:21.460
[yells]


01:06:21.634 --> 01:06:23.985
That was so not worth it!


01:06:24.986 --> 01:06:26.117
Ooh!


01:06:29.251 --> 01:06:30.992
You okay?Yeah. You good?


01:06:31.166 --> 01:06:31.905
Sonic!


01:06:32.080 --> 01:06:33.907
[Tom] Hey.[groaning]


01:06:34.082 --> 01:06:37.302
Sonic, one,
concrete boulder, zero.


01:06:37.476 --> 01:06:38.434
[sighing]


01:06:38.608 --> 01:06:39.913
Thanks for the save.


01:06:40.088 --> 01:06:41.611
Cutting it a little close,
don'’t you think?


01:06:43.047 --> 01:06:44.396
Secure the room!


01:06:46.398 --> 01:06:47.617
She'’s got the key.


01:06:50.359 --> 01:06:51.447
I got an idea.


01:07:00.673 --> 01:07:02.110
Commander Walters.


01:07:02.284 --> 01:07:03.372
Sir.


01:07:03.546 --> 01:07:05.156
You'’re...Still alive?


01:07:05.330 --> 01:07:08.116
I'’ll die before I let that key
fall into the wrong hands.


01:07:08.986 --> 01:07:10.379
Thanks for keeping it safe.


01:07:10.553 --> 01:07:12.033
I'’ll take it from here.


01:07:14.731 --> 01:07:16.559
That'’s an order,
Director Rockwell.


01:07:20.258 --> 01:07:22.913
Now, organize
the reinforcements.


01:07:24.262 --> 01:07:25.350
Yes, sir.


01:07:31.095 --> 01:07:33.315
Guys, guys, I got the key.
I repeat, I got the key.


01:07:33.489 --> 01:07:35.099
Now let'’s get out of here.


01:07:39.321 --> 01:07:41.584
Commander Walters.


01:07:41.758 --> 01:07:43.455
No, no. No. Wait!


01:07:57.730 --> 01:07:59.167
What?


01:07:59.341 --> 01:08:01.865
Tom! Everyone'’s clear!
Come on, let'’s go!


01:08:02.039 --> 01:08:03.910
You. What are you--


01:08:05.608 --> 01:08:06.652
Tom!


01:08:07.784 --> 01:08:09.829
Tom. Tom, what happened?


01:08:10.003 --> 01:08:11.527
Speak to me. Come on.


01:08:11.701 --> 01:08:13.877
Come on,
it'’s gonna be okay.


01:08:14.051 --> 01:08:17.098
Please, please, please get up.
Hey, come on, please wake up.


01:08:17.272 --> 01:08:18.882
Wake up, wake up, come on.


01:08:19.578 --> 01:08:20.971
Wake up, wake up, wake up!


01:08:21.667 --> 01:08:23.104
Maria.


01:08:27.151 --> 01:08:28.848
What did you do?


01:08:31.068 --> 01:08:33.114
What I had to.


01:08:35.768 --> 01:08:37.466
Oh, my God. Tom!


01:08:40.686 --> 01:08:42.384
Help me up, kid.


01:08:42.558 --> 01:08:44.125
[grunting]


01:08:45.213 --> 01:08:46.518
Freeze! Don'’t move!


01:08:46.692 --> 01:08:51.567
Any tricks up your sleeve,
Captain Grandtastic?


01:08:51.741 --> 01:08:53.177
[soldiers grunting]


01:08:55.397 --> 01:08:56.615
[terrified yelp]


01:08:58.313 --> 01:09:00.358
We got what we came for.


01:09:01.098 --> 01:09:03.970
Great job, Shadow.


01:09:04.710 --> 01:09:07.583
We have both keys.


01:09:07.757 --> 01:09:10.542
So where'’s your little
science project?


01:09:11.935 --> 01:09:15.895
It'’s closer than you think,
my boy.


01:09:18.071 --> 01:09:19.595
Welcome...[yelps]


01:09:19.769 --> 01:09:23.120
...to my masterpiece!


01:09:26.036 --> 01:09:27.777
I must hand it to GUN.


01:09:27.951 --> 01:09:31.389
They built her
to my exact specifications.


01:09:31.563 --> 01:09:32.738
It'’s...


01:09:34.392 --> 01:09:35.959
remarkable!


01:09:36.133 --> 01:09:37.352
Mm-hmm.


01:09:37.526 --> 01:09:40.355
Astounding!Yes.


01:09:41.486 --> 01:09:43.619
That'’s my genius grand-genome!


01:09:43.793 --> 01:09:47.405
And I have one more surprise.


01:09:49.886 --> 01:09:53.890
It'’s a new suit!


01:09:57.633 --> 01:09:59.548
[giddy squealing]


01:10:01.114 --> 01:10:03.291
[excited grunting]


01:10:03.465 --> 01:10:04.292
Gee.


01:10:04.466 --> 01:10:06.076
[smooching]


01:10:06.772 --> 01:10:08.818
[grunting]


01:10:23.833 --> 01:10:26.227
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:26.401 --> 01:10:28.490
♪ <i>I'’m a chip</i>
<i>Off the old block</i>♪


01:10:28.664 --> 01:10:31.449
♪ <i>I'’m a chip off</i>
<i>The old block!</i>♪


01:10:31.623 --> 01:10:32.929
[ring tone chiming]


01:10:33.103 --> 01:10:35.018
What do you want, Stone?
I'’m busy.


01:10:35.192 --> 01:10:38.195
Doctor, I have a bad feeling
about this.


01:10:38.369 --> 01:10:41.329
I don'’t think your grandfather'’s
been completely honest with us.


01:10:41.503 --> 01:10:43.200
It was something Shadow said.


01:10:43.983 --> 01:10:45.202
<i>There'’s more to their plan.</i>


01:10:46.638 --> 01:10:49.685
How dare you!


01:10:49.859 --> 01:10:52.644
You have been jealous
of my long-lost grand-Pop-Tart


01:10:52.818 --> 01:10:54.951
since the very beginning!


01:10:55.125 --> 01:10:57.780
I no longer require
your obsequious groveling.


01:10:57.954 --> 01:11:00.435
<i>Consider this your notice</i>
<i>of termination.</i>


01:11:00.609 --> 01:11:04.003
Your letter of reference
will be L for Loser.


01:11:04.177 --> 01:11:06.005
Of course,
I'’ll expect you to stay on


01:11:06.179 --> 01:11:07.659
until you'’ve been
successfully cloned.


01:11:07.833 --> 01:11:11.315
But you and I are done!


01:11:11.489 --> 01:11:13.926
Like a blackened
catfish dinner!


01:11:14.100 --> 01:11:17.365
Sir, it'’s too dangerous and
I'’m not there to protect you.


01:11:17.539 --> 01:11:18.670
I already lost you once! I--


01:11:18.844 --> 01:11:20.977
Unsubscribe.
Blocked and reported.


01:11:22.195 --> 01:11:24.110
[breath shaking]
I can'’t lose you again.


01:11:26.025 --> 01:11:27.636
[sighs]


01:11:30.552 --> 01:11:32.118
Do the honors...


01:11:32.858 --> 01:11:34.033
grandson.


01:11:35.948 --> 01:11:37.254
Here we go.


01:12:03.585 --> 01:12:05.761
[excited chatter]


01:12:40.448 --> 01:12:43.494
[sirens wailing][indistinct radio chatter]


01:13:03.340 --> 01:13:05.516
[siren wails]


01:13:11.522 --> 01:13:13.263
It'’ll be okay, Sonic.


01:13:13.437 --> 01:13:15.091
It'’ll be okay?


01:13:15.265 --> 01:13:17.789
Tom is fighting for his life
and you think it'’ll be okay?


01:13:17.963 --> 01:13:21.184
The fox is simply trying
to comfort you.


01:13:21.358 --> 01:13:23.229
Comfort'’s not
what I need right now.


01:13:23.404 --> 01:13:26.537
I need to stop them.
By any means necessary.


01:13:26.711 --> 01:13:27.886
Wait, you don'’t mean--


01:13:28.060 --> 01:13:30.149
The Master Emerald.


01:13:30.323 --> 01:13:33.501
The Emerald must never be
wielded for vengeance.


01:13:33.675 --> 01:13:34.719
Not ever!


01:13:34.893 --> 01:13:36.547
We swore a sacred oath.


01:13:36.721 --> 01:13:38.680
Don'’t talk to me about oaths.
Not now!


01:13:38.854 --> 01:13:40.725
But you told Tom
using the Emerald


01:13:40.899 --> 01:13:42.335
wasn'’t the right choice.


01:13:42.510 --> 01:13:44.599
Well, now it'’s the only choice.


01:13:44.773 --> 01:13:46.557
And if neither of you
have the guts to help me,


01:13:46.731 --> 01:13:48.167
then I'’ll do it alone.


01:13:48.341 --> 01:13:50.431
But I thought
the three of us were a team.


01:13:50.605 --> 01:13:52.607
I thought that'’s what
made us special.


01:13:52.781 --> 01:13:54.565
I'’m not asking you twice,
Knuckles.


01:13:55.436 --> 01:13:58.264
Where is the Master Emerald?


01:14:00.005 --> 01:14:03.356
Your heart is being consumed
by anger, hedgehog.


01:14:03.531 --> 01:14:06.577
You are in no condition
to make decisions right now.


01:14:06.751 --> 01:14:09.319
I know you'’re upset about Tom.
We all are.


01:14:09.493 --> 01:14:11.190
Last chance.


01:14:11.364 --> 01:14:13.976
Where... is it?


01:14:14.542 --> 01:14:16.065
Don'’t do this.


01:14:22.724 --> 01:14:25.683
Part of our oath
is to trust each other.


01:14:25.857 --> 01:14:28.077
And I must abide
by that promise,


01:14:28.251 --> 01:14:30.558
even if you have chosen
to break it.


01:14:30.732 --> 01:14:32.473
But heed this warning:


01:14:32.647 --> 01:14:35.998
The Master Emerald is guarded
by a fearsome warrior.


01:14:36.172 --> 01:14:38.348
And to seize
this ultimate power,


01:14:38.522 --> 01:14:40.437
you will have to go...


01:14:40.611 --> 01:14:42.657
through him.


01:14:42.831 --> 01:14:43.962
[exhales deeply]


01:14:44.136 --> 01:14:46.748
Okay, Wade...
all comes down to this.


01:14:47.488 --> 01:14:49.141
Last few seconds.


01:14:49.315 --> 01:14:50.447
Whipple down the ice.


01:14:50.621 --> 01:14:54.146
He shoots... he scores!


01:14:54.320 --> 01:14:57.367
Wade Whipple
is a champion again!


01:14:57.541 --> 01:14:58.716
[cackles]


01:15:03.286 --> 01:15:06.463
Oh, hey, Sonic. See my goal?
Pretty sick, right?


01:15:06.637 --> 01:15:08.465
I'’m here for the Emerald.


01:15:08.639 --> 01:15:10.162
Look, Sonic, I'’m sorry.


01:15:10.336 --> 01:15:12.513
I promised to guard this emerald
with my life.


01:15:12.687 --> 01:15:14.515
I will do whatever it takes--


01:15:15.646 --> 01:15:16.734
Well, I tried.


01:15:18.649 --> 01:15:20.869
[thunder rumbling]


01:15:22.174 --> 01:15:23.175
[Wade] Sonic!


01:15:27.092 --> 01:15:28.093
Too bright!


01:15:31.706 --> 01:15:34.752
[woman] <i>This is an urgent </i>
<i>national emergency broadcast.</i>


01:15:34.926 --> 01:15:37.363
<i>A spacecraft designed</i>
<i>by the agency GUN</i>


01:15:37.538 --> 01:15:40.453
<i>has been hijacked and launched </i>
<i>out of the River Thames.</i>


01:15:40.628 --> 01:15:44.240
[man broadcasting in Japanese]


01:15:46.242 --> 01:15:49.288
[man] <i>All residents are urged </i>
<i>to seek immediate shelter.</i>


01:16:11.354 --> 01:16:13.617
[Gerald] It'’s time, Shadow.


01:16:15.271 --> 01:16:19.362
Professor, is this really
what Maria would have wanted?


01:16:22.147 --> 01:16:25.498
The question isn'’t
what Maria would have wanted.


01:16:26.630 --> 01:16:28.632
It'’s what do they deserve.


01:16:29.633 --> 01:16:32.114
Remember what she meant to us.


01:16:33.985 --> 01:16:36.901
Remember what they took from us.


01:16:47.346 --> 01:16:48.391
[Gerald] Kids!


01:16:48.565 --> 01:16:50.480
We have to go, now!


01:16:50.654 --> 01:16:52.264
[Maria panting]


01:16:55.703 --> 01:16:58.140
[Gerald] They want to take
Shadow away from us, Maria!


01:17:02.971 --> 01:17:04.146
[weapons charging]


01:17:06.757 --> 01:17:09.455
Hey! Hey! What are you doing?
Those are children.


01:17:09.630 --> 01:17:11.414
We'’ve got our orders, Walters!Stand down!


01:17:13.068 --> 01:17:14.939
[gasps]


01:17:22.817 --> 01:17:24.819
[muffled rumbling]


01:17:26.211 --> 01:17:27.430
[high-pitched whistling]


01:17:27.604 --> 01:17:29.345
[groaning]


01:17:35.264 --> 01:17:36.482
Huh?


01:17:38.049 --> 01:17:39.137
Maria!


01:18:12.867 --> 01:18:14.259
[angry roar]


01:18:14.912 --> 01:18:16.697
[panting heavily]


01:18:26.619 --> 01:18:29.622
Excuse me,
Grand Paso Doble.


01:18:29.797 --> 01:18:32.756
What is that thermonuclear
gerbil doing?


01:18:32.930 --> 01:18:35.280
[Gerald] Infusing the core...


01:18:35.454 --> 01:18:36.934
with chaos energy.


01:18:37.108 --> 01:18:39.720
That'’s my little secret.


01:18:39.894 --> 01:18:42.505
The Eclipse Cannon
is about to turn this planet


01:18:42.679 --> 01:18:45.464
into a flaming pile
of rubble,


01:18:45.638 --> 01:18:50.469
wiping out everything
in a 25,000-mile radius.


01:18:53.646 --> 01:18:55.823
Including us.


01:18:59.740 --> 01:19:01.002
What?


01:19:01.916 --> 01:19:05.006
We can'’t annihilate
the Earth!


01:19:05.180 --> 01:19:09.619
Hmm?By combining our genius,
we can rule humanity.


01:19:09.793 --> 01:19:10.707
Together!


01:19:10.881 --> 01:19:13.971
Humanity is a failed experiment.


01:19:14.145 --> 01:19:16.365
If anyone should know that,
it'’s you.


01:19:18.106 --> 01:19:21.022
All your life, you'’ve been
rejected by this world.


01:19:21.892 --> 01:19:23.546
You have nothing down there.


01:19:25.156 --> 01:19:27.202
No one who cares about you.


01:19:28.986 --> 01:19:30.553
But I have you now.


01:19:33.251 --> 01:19:34.644
We'’re family.


01:19:35.558 --> 01:19:37.168
We have each other.


01:19:38.648 --> 01:19:39.910
Oh, Ivo...


01:19:41.738 --> 01:19:43.435
you'’re no Maria.


01:19:46.787 --> 01:19:50.747
The moment I lost her,
my family was gone forever!


01:19:52.401 --> 01:19:54.142
The only way
to give Maria'’s life meaning


01:19:54.316 --> 01:19:56.579
is to destroy the world
that took her from me.


01:19:57.449 --> 01:19:59.582
So I'’m burning it all down!


01:20:02.280 --> 01:20:03.455
It'’s done.


01:20:03.629 --> 01:20:05.936
Good work, Shadow.


01:20:06.110 --> 01:20:07.982
I'’m prepping
the firing sequence.


01:20:08.156 --> 01:20:12.029
The weapon will be fully charged
in ten minutes.


01:20:15.990 --> 01:20:18.079
It'’s almost finished, Maria.


01:20:18.993 --> 01:20:21.343
You will have justice.


01:20:21.517 --> 01:20:23.127
[muffled, distant boom]


01:20:25.738 --> 01:20:27.044
What is that?


01:20:27.958 --> 01:20:30.918
Is GUN launching
missiles at us?


01:20:31.092 --> 01:20:34.138
Impossible.
It'’s moving too fast.


01:20:37.359 --> 01:20:38.882
It'’s him.


01:20:43.234 --> 01:20:44.540
[wind whistling]


01:20:44.714 --> 01:20:46.194
[both grunting]


01:20:47.369 --> 01:20:51.677
You hurt my family.
This ends now!


01:20:51.852 --> 01:20:53.549
Now you know my anger.


01:20:53.723 --> 01:20:56.595
The pain I'’ve felt
for 50 years.


01:20:56.769 --> 01:21:00.034
And you'’ve made
the same choice I did.


01:21:00.208 --> 01:21:01.774
I'’m nothing like you!


01:21:01.949 --> 01:21:03.037
We'’ll see.


01:21:03.211 --> 01:21:05.648
[both yelling]


01:21:10.871 --> 01:21:12.481
Show yourself, coward!


01:21:13.699 --> 01:21:14.875
[grunts]


01:21:16.615 --> 01:21:17.703
[grunts]


01:21:18.530 --> 01:21:19.488
[gasps]


01:21:28.453 --> 01:21:30.673
[screams]


01:21:41.466 --> 01:21:42.728
[shouts]


01:21:42.903 --> 01:21:44.121
[thunder reverberating]


01:21:44.295 --> 01:21:45.949
You were right about one thing.


01:21:46.123 --> 01:21:47.168
[straining]


01:21:47.820 --> 01:21:50.171
This ends now.


01:21:50.867 --> 01:21:53.391
[both grunting]


01:22:16.762 --> 01:22:17.807
What'’s happening?


01:22:17.981 --> 01:22:19.113
Where are they?


01:22:20.157 --> 01:22:21.419
Up there.Where?


01:22:21.593 --> 01:22:22.507
Higher.Hmm?


01:22:22.681 --> 01:22:24.074
[shocked gagging]


01:22:24.248 --> 01:22:25.510
Left yourself open.


01:22:25.684 --> 01:22:27.469
Ivo! What are you doing?


01:22:27.643 --> 01:22:29.036
Thwarting your evil plan!


01:22:35.607 --> 01:22:37.522
[both howling in pain]


01:22:39.960 --> 01:22:41.918
Not the mustache!Agreed.


01:22:42.092 --> 01:22:44.790
Let go on three.
One, two, three!


01:22:45.574 --> 01:22:47.054
[whiskers flapping]


01:22:47.228 --> 01:22:48.403
[beeps]


01:22:49.970 --> 01:22:53.234
[mocking]
Oh... a nano-fist.


01:22:53.408 --> 01:22:57.107
I haven'’t seen that
since I hate-watched <i>Green Lantern</i>in 2011.


01:22:57.281 --> 01:22:59.240
I was saving it for Comic-Con.


01:22:59.414 --> 01:23:01.459
But now there won'’t
be a Comic-Con!


01:23:01.633 --> 01:23:02.678
[yells]


01:23:05.376 --> 01:23:06.987
[both grunting]


01:23:15.125 --> 01:23:17.345
[dust settling]


01:23:24.091 --> 01:23:27.137
Why are you alone?
Where are your friends?


01:23:27.311 --> 01:23:28.834
[straining]


01:23:29.009 --> 01:23:31.402
They tried to stop you,
didn'’t they?


01:23:31.576 --> 01:23:33.056
But you came anyway.


01:23:33.230 --> 01:23:35.667
Your anger was too much.


01:23:35.841 --> 01:23:38.583
What kind of hero
abandons his friends


01:23:38.757 --> 01:23:40.803
to pursue revenge?


01:23:40.977 --> 01:23:43.284
Abandons his family!


01:23:43.458 --> 01:23:46.069
Don'’t you dare talk
about my family.


01:23:46.243 --> 01:23:48.985
And here I thought
you cared for them.


01:23:49.159 --> 01:23:52.293
Especially the one...
What'’s his name?


01:23:52.467 --> 01:23:53.685
Tom?


01:23:53.859 --> 01:23:55.861
[angry howl]


01:24:14.184 --> 01:24:15.881
[Sonic yelling][gasps]


01:24:17.796 --> 01:24:19.885
[strained panting]


01:24:20.060 --> 01:24:22.453
Go ahead. Finish it!


01:24:24.151 --> 01:24:26.501
What are you waiting for? Do it!


01:24:26.675 --> 01:24:29.243
[grunting]I'’m right here!


01:24:30.418 --> 01:24:32.550
You didn'’t let your pain
change who you are...


01:24:33.986 --> 01:24:35.031
in here.


01:24:37.120 --> 01:24:38.904
[whimpering sigh]


01:24:43.474 --> 01:24:45.433
This is not who I am.


01:24:46.129 --> 01:24:47.783
What are you doing?


01:24:47.957 --> 01:24:50.829
You won. Take your revenge.


01:24:52.701 --> 01:24:54.833
There are no winners
with revenge.


01:25:08.151 --> 01:25:09.892
[Maria] <i>Wow.</i>


01:25:10.066 --> 01:25:11.502
[voice echoing]
Look at all those stars.


01:25:12.982 --> 01:25:14.592
<i>They'’re like diamonds.</i>


01:25:16.855 --> 01:25:20.207
The last time I sat
beneath stars like this...


01:25:22.209 --> 01:25:23.775
I was with her.


01:25:25.342 --> 01:25:27.866
I'’ve felt this pain for so long.


01:25:29.564 --> 01:25:31.261
It'’s all I know.


01:25:31.435 --> 01:25:33.655
When I lost Longclaw...


01:25:33.829 --> 01:25:35.526
I felt the same way.


01:25:37.311 --> 01:25:39.748
Did your pain eventually
go away?


01:25:39.922 --> 01:25:41.880
No.


01:25:42.054 --> 01:25:43.969
But in time,
I learned there'’s something


01:25:44.144 --> 01:25:46.450
even more powerful than pain.


01:25:46.624 --> 01:25:48.713
The love we felt for each other.


01:25:49.932 --> 01:25:51.760
That'’s what you need
to hold on to, Shadow.


01:25:51.934 --> 01:25:54.154
Maria might be gone,


01:25:54.328 --> 01:25:56.330
but your love
will always remain.


01:26:10.996 --> 01:26:15.000
"The light shines
even though the star is gone."


01:26:20.092 --> 01:26:22.007
[cannon rumbling in distance]


01:26:26.838 --> 01:26:28.753
This whole mess
is my fault.


01:26:28.927 --> 01:26:31.756
I'’ve been so blinded by rage,
I thought...


01:26:32.453 --> 01:26:34.237
I had no choice.


01:26:37.762 --> 01:26:40.156
You always have a choice.


01:26:45.117 --> 01:26:47.859
But making the right one
is never easy.


01:26:48.033 --> 01:26:49.731
One more thing I learned


01:26:49.905 --> 01:26:52.690
is that when you
really screw something up,


01:26:52.864 --> 01:26:54.344
you can'’t fix it
on your own.


01:26:54.518 --> 01:26:56.738
["Live and Learn"
by Crush 40 playing]


01:27:09.533 --> 01:27:11.187
Gotta go fast.


01:27:11.361 --> 01:27:13.711
Don'’t tell me you'’ve
got a catchphrase.


01:27:13.885 --> 01:27:17.237
That'’s right, new hedgehog.
And everyone loves it.


01:27:32.991 --> 01:27:36.168
I... will... not... try...[grunting]


01:27:36.343 --> 01:27:39.302
...to stop... my...
elders... from...


01:27:39.476 --> 01:27:41.870
destroying... the... world!


01:27:42.697 --> 01:27:43.915
[screams]


01:27:47.528 --> 01:27:49.443
Playtime is over.


01:27:58.147 --> 01:28:00.367
There'’s no going back now.


01:28:00.541 --> 01:28:03.500
[wheezing grunts]


01:28:04.545 --> 01:28:06.895
Set up defense.


01:28:08.853 --> 01:28:10.159
Damn you, autocorrect!


01:28:10.333 --> 01:28:11.595
[attacking grunt]


01:28:14.250 --> 01:28:15.338
[shouts]


01:28:16.034 --> 01:28:17.079
Mantis!


01:28:19.037 --> 01:28:20.300
Oh!


01:28:22.389 --> 01:28:23.520
[cackles]


01:28:23.694 --> 01:28:24.782
Whee!


01:28:25.566 --> 01:28:26.697
[hissing growl]


01:28:26.871 --> 01:28:29.483
I'’m right here,
arach-nerd.


01:28:30.222 --> 01:28:31.049
[shouts]


01:28:31.223 --> 01:28:33.965
[both grunting]


01:28:36.664 --> 01:28:39.797
[cackles]


01:28:39.971 --> 01:28:42.713
That'’s what I call
mantis-scaping.


01:28:42.887 --> 01:28:45.325
That'’s elder abuse!


01:28:48.937 --> 01:28:51.243
[exclaims]


01:28:51.418 --> 01:28:54.638
[female computer voice]
<i>Alert! Alert! Alert!</i>


01:28:54.812 --> 01:28:56.205
Shadow...


01:28:56.379 --> 01:28:58.990
I see you'’ve chosen betrayal.


01:29:00.165 --> 01:29:02.820
And you were once
so useful to me.


01:29:18.532 --> 01:29:20.708
Ready to recycle
some tin cans?


01:29:20.882 --> 01:29:22.492
Just try to keep up.


01:29:53.784 --> 01:29:55.177
[Robotnik]
Please, Grampsy,


01:29:55.351 --> 01:29:57.092
don'’t do this!


01:29:57.266 --> 01:29:59.355
Sorry, kiddo.


01:29:59.529 --> 01:30:02.750
Bring Your Grandkid to Work Day
is over.


01:30:02.924 --> 01:30:03.968
[device beeping]


01:30:04.142 --> 01:30:06.231
[air whistling]


01:30:06.406 --> 01:30:08.756
[yelping]


01:30:08.930 --> 01:30:10.714
Any last words?


01:30:10.888 --> 01:30:13.587
Just one thing...


01:30:14.588 --> 01:30:16.677
that I never thought I'’d say.


01:30:16.851 --> 01:30:18.330
What is it?


01:30:18.505 --> 01:30:20.985
"I love you"?


01:30:21.638 --> 01:30:22.944
No.


01:30:23.118 --> 01:30:25.033
It was something even better.


01:30:25.207 --> 01:30:27.296
But I'’m not gonna say it
if that'’s the way you'’re gonna be.


01:30:27.470 --> 01:30:29.429
Okay. Bye.


01:30:30.430 --> 01:30:32.432
[screaming]


01:30:36.740 --> 01:30:39.047
[cackling]


01:30:39.221 --> 01:30:40.178
[hissing inhale]


01:30:40.352 --> 01:30:41.397
[happy grunt]


01:30:42.311 --> 01:30:44.182
Grandchildren.


01:30:44.356 --> 01:30:47.969
All the fun
and none of the responsibility.


01:30:50.101 --> 01:30:52.887
Who said life was pointless?


01:30:53.670 --> 01:30:56.586
Huh?Oh, right. You did.


01:30:56.760 --> 01:30:57.935
[growls][electricity buzzes]


01:30:58.109 --> 01:30:59.720
[screams]


01:31:00.938 --> 01:31:02.244
[faint zap]


01:31:02.418 --> 01:31:03.941
[Tails, Knuckles cheering][Knuckles] Victory!


01:31:04.115 --> 01:31:06.466
Say what you want
about my granddad,


01:31:06.640 --> 01:31:08.468
he made one
hell of a bug zapper.


01:31:09.294 --> 01:31:10.513
[groans softly]


01:31:10.687 --> 01:31:12.515
We got to stop that laser!


01:31:12.689 --> 01:31:14.909
I knew there was something
I was forgetting.


01:31:25.485 --> 01:31:28.662
We'’re out of time.
The cannon is about to fire!


01:31:28.836 --> 01:31:30.054
Where are you?


01:31:30.228 --> 01:31:32.753
Oh, you know,
just making friends.


01:31:32.927 --> 01:31:34.624
They'’re all yours.


01:31:38.236 --> 01:31:39.890
[laughing]


01:31:43.328 --> 01:31:44.852
[Sonic] Follow me!


01:31:50.945 --> 01:31:53.513
Now, this might hurt a little!


01:31:54.731 --> 01:31:56.951
[all exclaiming]


01:32:07.352 --> 01:32:10.138
So this was your plan?


01:32:10.312 --> 01:32:11.835
[straining] Yeah...


01:32:12.009 --> 01:32:15.491
Would someone mind
shutting down the giant death ray?


01:32:17.928 --> 01:32:19.756
We can'’t stop the cannon
from firing...


01:32:19.930 --> 01:32:22.019
But we can steer it away
from the Earth.


01:32:22.193 --> 01:32:24.544
Coming around to starboard.Aye-aye, Doc.


01:32:28.504 --> 01:32:30.550
Here we go.


01:32:31.768 --> 01:32:33.596
[Tails grunting][Robotnik] It'’s a little tight.


01:32:34.379 --> 01:32:36.599
Definitely not power steering.


01:32:42.518 --> 01:32:45.434
Keep... turning.[straining]


01:32:48.045 --> 01:32:49.873
Jump in anytime here, guys!


01:32:50.047 --> 01:32:51.179
[all straining]


01:32:51.353 --> 01:32:52.833
[steady beeping]


01:32:55.531 --> 01:32:59.361
Can'’t... hold... much... longer.


01:32:59.535 --> 01:33:01.493
[all yelling]


01:33:03.408 --> 01:33:05.236
[exhausted groan]


01:33:08.675 --> 01:33:10.285
[groans]


01:33:16.987 --> 01:33:18.119
Yes![cheering]


01:33:18.293 --> 01:33:20.556
I did it! I did it!


01:33:23.864 --> 01:33:25.561
Oh!Ooh!


01:33:26.214 --> 01:33:27.345
Look what you did!


01:33:27.519 --> 01:33:30.131
Hey, look down there!Sonic!


01:33:36.224 --> 01:33:38.313
Oh, Knuckles,
please tell me you have a--


01:33:38.487 --> 01:33:40.184
Last one.


01:33:40.358 --> 01:33:41.751
Let'’s make it count.


01:33:44.319 --> 01:33:46.364
Ready for a little base of ball?


01:33:47.409 --> 01:33:49.019
Deep breath.


01:33:49.193 --> 01:33:51.892
One... two... three!


01:33:52.936 --> 01:33:55.417
[Knuckles grunting]


01:33:55.591 --> 01:33:56.984
[yells]


01:34:12.260 --> 01:34:13.565
[shocked yell]


01:34:13.740 --> 01:34:15.872
Really!What'’s happening?


01:34:16.046 --> 01:34:18.527
The reactor core is overloading.


01:34:18.701 --> 01:34:21.051
It'’s only a matter of time
before it blows.


01:34:21.225 --> 01:34:22.966
So what does that mean
for Earth?


01:34:23.140 --> 01:34:25.795
A radioactive atmosphere.


01:34:25.969 --> 01:34:28.450
Rain that kills the crops
and melts your flesh.


01:34:28.624 --> 01:34:29.886
Other than that...


01:34:30.060 --> 01:34:31.714
We'’re not done here!


01:34:31.888 --> 01:34:33.803
You try to stabilize
the reactor.


01:34:33.977 --> 01:34:35.196
Buy me some time.


01:34:35.370 --> 01:34:37.415
I'’ll push the station
away from Earth


01:34:37.589 --> 01:34:39.026
before it explodes.


01:34:39.200 --> 01:34:43.204
This is our last chance
to do the right thing.


01:34:44.858 --> 01:34:47.469
[in Spanish]
Go with God


01:34:47.643 --> 01:34:49.863
stinking hedgehog.


01:34:51.125 --> 01:34:53.431
[female computer voice]
<i>Core integrity failing.</i>


01:35:02.614 --> 01:35:04.268
I'’ve got you, Sonic!


01:35:06.270 --> 01:35:07.445
[gasps]


01:35:07.619 --> 01:35:09.230
[moans]


01:35:15.889 --> 01:35:17.325
[straining]


01:35:37.606 --> 01:35:41.001
[computer] <i>Initializing</i>
<i>reactor core stabilizers.</i>


01:35:59.715 --> 01:36:02.413
This is Doctor Ivo Robotnik,


01:36:02.587 --> 01:36:05.329
dedicating my final livestream


01:36:05.503 --> 01:36:08.245
to one very special henchman:


01:36:08.855 --> 01:36:10.247
<i>Agent Stone.</i>


01:36:10.421 --> 01:36:12.641
No, no. Doctor, wait!


01:36:12.815 --> 01:36:15.209
<i>If I can'’t</i>
<i>rule the world...</i>


01:36:16.210 --> 01:36:18.038
I might as well save it...


01:36:18.212 --> 01:36:21.345
for the one and only person
who ever cared about me.


01:36:21.519 --> 01:36:23.434
Don'’t do this, Doctor, please!


01:36:23.608 --> 01:36:27.221
Stone, you were more
than a sycophant to me.


01:36:30.093 --> 01:36:31.355
You were...


01:36:32.835 --> 01:36:34.358
a syco-friend.


01:36:39.929 --> 01:36:43.454
I'’ll miss your lattes
with steamed Austrian goat milk.


01:36:45.413 --> 01:36:47.284
I love the way you make '’em!


01:37:30.371 --> 01:37:34.201
So... I guess there'’s
only one thing left to say.


01:37:34.984 --> 01:37:37.421
[mimics robotic servos]


01:37:38.988 --> 01:37:40.468
It'’s been a real drag.


01:37:41.164 --> 01:37:42.644
Thanks for nothing.


01:37:54.830 --> 01:37:56.440
[birds chirping faintly]


01:37:58.399 --> 01:37:59.966
[coughing]


01:38:01.228 --> 01:38:02.403
Sonic, look.


01:38:12.630 --> 01:38:14.502
Shadow and Robotnik.


01:38:14.676 --> 01:38:16.896
They sacrificed
themselves...


01:38:17.070 --> 01:38:19.072
to save everyone.


01:38:19.811 --> 01:38:21.857
You always have a choice.


01:38:23.119 --> 01:38:25.861
Guys, I'’m really sorry
for running off like that.


01:38:26.035 --> 01:38:27.645
I shouldn'’t have
left you behind.


01:38:29.430 --> 01:38:31.040
The truth is...


01:38:31.214 --> 01:38:33.869
you'’re the best teammates
a hedgehog could ever ask for.


01:38:35.610 --> 01:38:37.438
And the best friends.


01:38:37.612 --> 01:38:39.483
Can you ever forgive me?


01:38:43.574 --> 01:38:45.359
Team Sonic?


01:38:49.450 --> 01:38:52.061
[Sonic]
How about just "team"?


01:39:00.374 --> 01:39:01.984
Goodbye, Doctor.


01:39:18.522 --> 01:39:20.829
[Sonic] Big finish.[Knuckles] Mmm!


01:39:22.352 --> 01:39:24.789
Now that'’s
what I call teamwork.


01:39:24.964 --> 01:39:26.748
Okay! It'’s ready!


01:39:26.922 --> 01:39:28.402
[munching]


01:39:28.576 --> 01:39:29.751
[gasps]


01:39:29.925 --> 01:39:31.579
Knuckles,
how could you?


01:39:31.753 --> 01:39:33.581
Gotta be faster than that!


01:39:34.495 --> 01:39:35.583
Give me a break.


01:39:35.757 --> 01:39:37.063
Still moving a little slow
over here.


01:39:37.237 --> 01:39:39.021
Donut Lord!Yay!


01:39:39.195 --> 01:39:40.718
[pained groan]


01:39:40.892 --> 01:39:43.547
Okay, Knuckles, that'’s...I am having the love.


01:39:43.721 --> 01:39:45.071
[barks]
I want the love!


01:39:45.245 --> 01:39:47.943
[Tails] Aww...Get in here, Ozzy.


01:39:48.117 --> 01:39:49.814
It'’s great
to be back together.


01:39:49.989 --> 01:39:51.816
We'’re stronger than ever.


01:39:51.991 --> 01:39:54.428
And nothing is gonna
stand in our way.


01:39:55.777 --> 01:39:59.607
Except that one piece
of unfinished business.


01:40:08.659 --> 01:40:11.662
And way out in front, to the
surprise of absolutely no one,


01:40:11.836 --> 01:40:13.012
it'’s the Blue Blur!


01:40:13.186 --> 01:40:14.926
Often imitated,
never duplicated,


01:40:15.101 --> 01:40:16.319
the one, the only...


01:40:16.493 --> 01:40:17.233
[yells]


01:40:17.407 --> 01:40:18.887
Let'’s do this!


01:40:19.061 --> 01:40:21.237
Yeah! [laughs]


01:40:21.411 --> 01:40:24.501
[yells]All right, boys,
try and keep up.


01:40:25.198 --> 01:40:27.069
[all cheering, whooping]


01:40:31.595 --> 01:40:34.598
["Run It"
by Jelly Roll playing]


01:42:20.922 --> 01:42:24.447
Sonic the Hedgehog
is Family Champion once again!


01:42:25.100 --> 01:42:26.145
Tails?


01:42:26.710 --> 01:42:28.234
Knuckles?


01:42:29.887 --> 01:42:32.847
Okay. Yeah, I overshot
the finish line.


01:42:36.764 --> 01:42:38.244
[electronic whirring]


01:42:41.769 --> 01:42:44.772
[Sonic] Okay,
so how do I get back?


01:42:47.296 --> 01:42:49.037
[weapon powering up]


01:42:49.820 --> 01:42:51.822
[beeping]


01:42:56.175 --> 01:42:57.263
[Sonic] Pro tip:


01:42:57.437 --> 01:42:58.655
If you'’re gonna take a shot


01:42:58.829 --> 01:43:00.962
at the fastest creature
in the universe...


01:43:03.312 --> 01:43:04.922
you'’d better not miss.


01:43:08.752 --> 01:43:11.364
Um... I'’m flattered
by the cosplay,


01:43:11.538 --> 01:43:13.235
but you got
a few details wrong.


01:43:13.409 --> 01:43:16.282
I can'’t blame you, though.
It'’s hard to copy perfection.


01:43:26.379 --> 01:43:28.381
That'’s a neat trick.


01:43:36.998 --> 01:43:38.217
[Sonic yelps]


01:43:40.306 --> 01:43:42.221
What? Who are you?

